<title>MOROCCO: Three tourists die in Morocco plane crash.</title>
<headline>Three tourists die in Morocco plane crash.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three tourists, two Swiss and a German, were killed when the light aircraft carrying them to the southern Moroccan city of Ouarzazate crashed, the Moroccan nes agency MAP said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the plane left on Tuesday for Ouarzazate  from Marrakesh and crashed early in the afternoon in hazey weather.</p>
<p>The two embassies confirmed the crash but declined to identify the two Swiss men and the German woman.</p>
</text>
